{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_017000","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Snake，说到纸箱……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":26,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"哦！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":6,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"由我来给你讲纸箱，总觉得有点奇怪，不过保险起见还是让我说明一下吧。毕竟这次和以前有不少不同。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":138,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"明白。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"纸箱不只是能套在身上藏起来，也可以直接放在原地。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"哦。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":6,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"站到上面可以翻过一点高差，也能躲在后面避开敌兵的视线。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"这变化不错啊。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"不止如此。还可以往里面装道具，送给CO-OPS的同伴。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"还能这么用？果然纸箱无所不能，是战士的必需品。这个用法我倒没想到。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"不，这本来才是纸箱的正常用法……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"说起来，这附近的纸箱是不是稍微大了一点？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"对。两个人紧贴在一起的话，应该能一起钻进去。俗称『Love Cardboard』。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":95,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"Love Cardboard……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":20,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"对。不过也不只Love Cardboard，只要大小一样，其他纸箱也能两个人一起进去。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":101,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"}]}